  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Frank Bisignano described artificial intelligence as a major efficiency opportunity and a strategic advantage. He said AI would be brought into the phone system and that the phone system must have AI to do the work. He said AI would bend the cost curve and be used throughout many processes, with a human responsible for validating results. In June 2025 testimony he cited accelerated AI investments to enhance employee productivity, and in March 2026 he said AI would be part of increasing the compliance rate.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s6",
    "s2",
    "s3",
